<title>USA: Equitrac sets share buyback budget.</title>
<headline>Equitrac sets share buyback budget.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitrac Corp said Monday its board of directors authorized the company to spend up to $2.5 million to repurchase common shares.</p>
<p>The company said purchases would be subject to prevailing market conditions and executed in open market or privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
